{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0284_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5d4dc2c2d2e328d174030f2d59e88c4a64739238ca19aba88a4153669b6ea403", "ja": "（今日はやよいのPV撮影の日だ。大がかりな\n撮影のため、現場にはかなりの人数が集まっている）", "zh": "（今天是弥生拍摄PV的日子。由于是大规模拍摄，现场聚集了相当多的人）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0284_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "4e2792d4ee699711ec7128f25e92cb6d2f294efb6c4e2af01897c4bca0f6279a", "ja": "うっうー！　{$P$}、見てください！\nスタッフさんがいっぱいですーっ！", "zh": "呜～呜～！　{$P$}，快看！\n有好多工作人员呢——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0284_1002_005yay", "source_sha256": "b2e6db11e559decfae32d12f7700ff022b78854544d5f6f6d6ba4cd25c81ad36", "ja": "照明さんにカメラマンさんに、監督さん！\nあと、あっちで星を飾ってくれてるのは……", "zh": "灯光师、摄影师，还有导演！\n另外，那边正在装饰星星的是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0284_1003_p", "source_sha256": "88fb0e0a8859b3d1c6be5dfe942f39171c24335479edd14e26766b9a784d1cd0", "ja": "たぶん、プロップスタイリストさんかな？\n小物や装飾で、PVの世界を彩ってくれる人だよ。", "zh": "可能是道具造型师吧？\n他们会用小道具和装饰，为PV的世界增添色彩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0284_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "3df2d4ea714e41cb83a269a89a7a6e82a8a4175f06739d53a2a2a17fc61bc607", "ja": "{$P$}、すごいですね……。\nこんなにたくさんの人と一緒に撮影できるなんて。", "zh": "{$P$}，真厉害啊……。\n居然能和这么多人一起拍摄。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0284_1005_p", "source_sha256": "dcdb56601aea989947d1fef89f4aee0df5f414c3ad5c9f087ae12b1b23333afe", "ja": "ああ。これもやよいが頑張ってきたおかげだな。\nやよいの持つ輝きが、多くの人を惹きつけたんだ。", "zh": "是啊。这也多亏了弥生一直以来的努力。\n弥生所拥有的光芒，吸引了许多人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0284_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "524df2a979d207e074a8b6da9d5a1eb6275bce9219484c6172600c82045b8435", "ja": "私の、輝きが……？　なんか照れちゃいます～。\nでも、それってなんだか『星』みたいですね。", "zh": "我的光芒……？总觉得有点不好意思～。\n不过，这样听起来好像星星一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0284_1007_p", "source_sha256": "b50d1ba9bcf1c2a37018777bb889fc75210fc4ad777ff9bf9adecc2564957f1d", "ja": "星？", "zh": "星星？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0284_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "8982a3a145eaa59f9774679a563c98818bd6368461afc421d0395bb47e6f185a", "ja": "はい！　星って、最初は少ししか見えないのに、\n時間がたつと、だんだんキラキラが増えていって……", "zh": "是的！星星一开始只能看到一点点，可随着时间推移，闪闪发光的星星会渐渐变多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0284_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "21250d97198769c5ff15a7c343d6171bb8585dc8477beec37c87149e3c984949", "ja": "最後には、こーんなキレイな星空になるんです！", "zh": "最后，就变成这么美丽的星空了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0284_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "273d1ce377d6f9afcf45f57f72906a8be4ff18e667f0830e571d79793050839e", "ja": "だから星みたいだなーって！　ファンのみんなと、\nスタッフさんと、私たち、みんなで作る星空です！", "zh": "所以我才觉得像星星嘛！这是由粉丝们、工作人员，还有我们大家一起创造出的星空！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0284_1011_p", "source_sha256": "3752d41baabc2fc46f64b1726ceed2fe8d8110e33de3eba39ac77cca64f9b620", "ja": "なるほど。\nやよいらしくて素敵な考え方だな。", "zh": "原来如此。\n很有弥生的风格，是个很棒的想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0284_1012_005yay", "source_sha256": "3c07da4fbf2cb05ffdc7c97355cf5bd8b5ce8dcec34fb210026410084b921a51", "ja": "えへへ♪　……{$P$}、\nありがとうございます！　ずっと、見守っててくれて。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪……{$P$}，谢谢您！一直以来，都在守护着我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0284_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d403efea8d4095754605dbcfc0d4f64397759534722c020983d25d813928b171", "ja": "うん？　どうしたんだ、改まって。", "zh": "嗯？怎么了，突然这么郑重。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0284_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "8ae7cd5fd07a3b1dc7c233378c915d55ebaf286b0e7498e7cb4d7b3e9e2957f0", "ja": "アイドルになってからいろんなことがあったなーって！\nなんかちょっぴり思い出しちゃいました。", "zh": "成为偶像后，经历了好多事情啊——！\n不知怎么的，稍微回想起来了一些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0284_1015_p", "source_sha256": "9d90ee598ef0ebef6287312113e60fc6b1abb5842f78a04a27851f41070adb01", "ja": "そうだな。でも、思い出話にはまだ早いぞ！\nやよいはまだまだ、満天の星を作っていくんだから。", "zh": "是啊。不过现在还不是回忆往事的时候！\n弥生还要继续创造满天繁星呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0284_1016_005yay", "source_sha256": "48ea1ee25c2f4b3fbd8d5806eb50f208f54cbb7aaae7e5271d0cff9f5c7c6512", "ja": "満天の星……。", "zh": "满天的星空……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0284_1017_005yay", "source_sha256": "5425f75b4a784e28edbd4cc4ee930e765e637a87184cb52a7ff839c6e8a68890", "ja": "そうですね！　みんなで一緒に、\nもっともーっとキラキラな星空を作れるように！", "zh": "是呀！为了和大家一起，创造出更加——更加璀璨的星空！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0284_1018_005yay", "source_sha256": "cab1c71a6ee016ed59d42ac7e0c9d4e843455f31b120fb53bb0e767923c7012f", "ja": "うっうー！　{$P$}、\n私、もっともーっと頑張りまーっす！", "zh": "呜呜——！{$P$}，我会更加更加努力的——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
